</span><span begin="28:16.748" end="28:16.968" podcasts:unit="word">auch</span><span begin="28:16.968" end="28:17.108" podcasts:unit="word">einen</span><span begin="28:17.108" end="28:17.488" podcasts:unit="word">kleinen</span><span begin="28:17.488" end="28:18.028" podcasts:unit="word">Prozentanteil,</span><span begin="28:18.028" end="28:18.148" podcasts:unit="word">der</span><span begin="28:18.148" end="28:18.328" podcasts:unit="word">sich</span><span begin="28:18.328" end="28:18.728" podcasts:unit="word">schafft</span><span begin="28:18.728" end="28:19.248" podcasts:unit="word">inhaltlich.</span></span><span begin="28:20.588" end="28:23.888" podcasts:unit="sentence"><span begin="28:20.588" end="28:21.268" podcasts:unit="word">Vor</span><span begin="28:21.268" end="28:21.468" podcasts:unit="word">allen</span><span begin="28:21.468" end="28:21.608" podcasts:unit="word">Dingen,</span><span begin="28:21.608" end="28:21.708" podcasts:unit="word">die</span><span begin="28:21.708" end="28:22.328" podcasts:unit="word">mathematischen</span><span begin="28:22.328" end="28:22.908" podcasts:unit="word">Anforderungen</span><span begin="28:23.148" end="28:23.308" podcasts:unit="word">zu</span><span begin="28:23.308" end="28:23.648" podcasts:unit="word">heftig</span><span begin="28:23.648" end="28:23.888" podcasts:unit="word">sind.</span></span><span begin="28:23.888" end="28:29.128" podcasts:unit="sentence"><span begin="28:23.888" end="28:24.008" podcasts:unit="word">Aber</span><span begin="28:24.008" end="28:24.088" podcasts:unit="word">das</span><span begin="28:24.088" end="28:24.208" podcasts:unit="word">ist</span><span begin="28:24.208" end="28:24.388" podcasts:unit="word">kein</span><span begin="28:24.388" end="28:25.308" podcasts:unit="word">Wissenschaftsproblem,</span><span begin="28:25.308" end="28:26.288" podcasts:unit="word">sondern</span><span begin="28:26.288" end="28:26.368" podcasts:unit="word">die</span><span begin="28:26.368" end="28:26.508" podcasts:unit="word